  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-001_chunk_1",
    "document_id": "journal-001",
    "content": "My main technical goals are system design, cloud infrastructure, backend engineering, and practical AI application development. I also want to become more comfortable explaining trade-offs in interviews.",
