    "chunk_id": "journal-002_chunk_0",
    "document_id": "journal-002",
    "content": "My mornings have been inconsistent, especially on days when I work late the previous evening. I experimented with preparing everything the night before: clothes, water bottle, breakfast ingredients, and a short list of priorities.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-06",
      "topic": "Morning Routine",
      "entry_id": "journal-002",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "filename": "02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "file_type": "markdown",
      "title": "Morning Routine",
      "date_object": "2026-01-06",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "chunking_method": "semantic",
      "sentence_start": 0,
      "sentence_end": 1,
      "sentence_count": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-002_chunk_1",
    "document_id": "journal-002",
    "content": "The small amount of preparation made getting started easier. I also decided not to check social media immediately after waking up.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-06",
      "topic": "Morning Routine",
      "entry_id": "journal-002",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "filename": "02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "file_type": "markdown",
      "title": "Morning Routine",
      "date_object": "2026-01-06",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunking_method": "semantic",
      "sentence_start": 2,
      "sentence_end": 3,
      "sentence_count": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-002_chunk_2",
    "document_id": "journal-002",
    "content": "Instead, I spend the first few minutes reviewing the day's calendar and deciding what absolutely needs attention. This is not a rigid productivity system.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-06",
      "topic": "Morning Routine",
      "entry_id": "journal-002",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "filename": "02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "file_type": "markdown",
      "title": "Morning Routine",
      "date_object": "2026-01-06",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunking_method": "semantic",
      "sentence_start": 4,
      "sentence_end": 5,
      "sentence_count": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-002_chunk_3",
    "document_id": "journal-002",
    "content": "I mainly want fewer decisions before I become fully alert. I noticed that when I start calmly, I am less likely to spend the first hour reacting to messages.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-06",
      "topic": "Morning Routine",
      "entry_id": "journal-002",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "filename": "02_2026-01-06_morning_routine.md",
      "file_type": "markdown",
      "title": "Morning Routine",
      "date_object": "2026-01-06",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunking_method": "semantic",
      "sentence_start": 6,
      "sentence_end": 7,
      "sentence_count": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-002_chunk_4",
    "document_id": "journal-002",
    "content": "I want to keep this routine for several weeks before deciding whether it is actually useful.",
