  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-004_chunk_1",
    "document_id": "journal-004",
    "content": "I applied that idea to technical learning by leaving my notebook open on the desk and keeping a small list of questions next to the computer. I also started making shorter reading notes.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-14",
      "topic": "Reading",
      "entry_id": "journal-004",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\04_2026-01-14_reading.md",
      "filename": "04_2026-01-14_reading.md",
      "file_type": "markdown",
      "title": "Reading",
      "date_object": "2026-01-14",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chunking_method": "semantic",
      "sentence_start": 2,
      "sentence_end": 3,
      "sentence_count": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "journal-004_chunk_2",
    "document_id": "journal-004",
    "content": "Instead of trying to capture every interesting sentence, I record the main argument, one example, and whether I think the idea is applicable to my own work. This should make the notes more useful for future retrieval.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-14",
      "topic": "Reading",
      "entry_id": "journal-004",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\04_2026-01-14_reading.md",
      "filename": "04_2026-01-14_reading.md",
      "file_type": "markdown",
      "title": "Reading",
      "date_object": "2026-01-14",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunking_method": "semantic",
      "sentence_start": 4,
      "sentence_end": 5,
