    "content": "I noticed that exercise affects my evening study sessions more than I expected. On days when I take a walk after work, I transition out of work mode more easily and can concentrate on learning afterward.",
    "metadata": {
      "date": "2026-01-18",
      "topic": "Fitness",
      "entry_id": "journal-005",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Home\\Documents\\ragJournal\\dataset\\05_2026-01-18_fitness.md",
